<title>BRAZIL: Dow, Petrobras, YPF in talks to build gasline.</title>
<headline>Dow, Petrobras, YPF in talks to build gasline.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dow Chemical Co said it is negotiating with Argentina's YPF, Brazil's Petrobras and some other smaller firms to build a $400 million gas pipeline in Argentina.</p>
<p>&quot;The decision will be made in the next 90 days,&quot; Luciano Respini, president of Dow Brasil and head of Dow's Latin America operations, told reporters.</p>
</text>
